{"strongs": "H6258", "word": "עַתָּ֫ה", "translit": "at.tah", "root": "עתה", "morph": "H:Adv", "pos": "adverb", "gloss": "now", "definition": "עַתָּ֫ה 435 (also Ezek 23:43 ; Ps 74:6 עת Kt , Qr עַתָּה ), עָ֑֫תָּה Gen 32:5 +, adverb of time, now (properly accusative of [ `int ], עֵת ( Kö ii. 260 ), at the time , in particular of the present time, i.e. now ; compare German zur Zeit , Arabic at the time , i.e. now); — now: 1. a. Gen 12:19 ועתה הנה אשׁתך and now , behold thy wife, Gen 22:12 כי עתח ידעתי now , I know (so Exod 18:11 ; Judg 17:13 ; 1Kgs 17:24 [ עַתָּה זֶה ], Ps 20:7 ), Gen 26:22 ; Gen 26:29 ; Gen 27:36 ; Gen 31:13 ; Gen 31:28 , etc., Exod 5:5 הך רבים עתה עם הארץ ; whether in opposed to past time, as Gen 32:11 ; Josh 14:11 כְּכֹחִי אָז וּכְכֹחִי עָ֑תָּה , Judg 11:8 ; 1Kgs 12:4 ; Isa 1:21 ועתה מרצחים , Isa 16:14 ; Hos 2:9 כִּי טוֺב לִי אָז מַעָ֑תָּה , Hos 13:2 , Job 30:1 +, or to future, as Num 24:17 אֶרְאֶנּוּ ולא עתה , Judg 8:6 חֲכַף עַתָּהכְּֿיָדֶ֑ךָ ׳ זֶבַח וצ , 1Sam 2:16 כִּי עַתָּה תִּתֵּן ; = after all Num 22:38 ; Judg 8:2 = now at last 2Sam 24:16 ; 1Kgs 19:4 ; 2Kgs 19:25 ; Hos 7:2 ; Jer 4:12 and in the phrase מעתה ועד עולם Isa 9:6 ; Isa 59:21 ; (see below), Ps 113:2 ; Ps 115:18 ; Ps 121:8 ; Ps 125:2 ; Ps 131:3 . \\ \\ b. of the imminent or impending future: Gen 19:9 עַתָּה נָרַע לְךָ מַהֶם . Gen 29:32 כי עתה יאהבני אישׁי , v Gen 29:34 ; Exod 6:1 עתה תראה , Num 11:23 ; Num 22:4 ; 2Sam 20:6 ; Isa 33:10 ( Ps 12:6 ), Isa 43:19 ; Isa 49:19 ; Amos 6:7 לכן עתה יִגְלוּ , Isa 49:19 ; Mic 7:4 ; Mic 7:10 ; Dan 10:20 and especially ἀσυνδέτως in Hosea, introducing a punishment, Hos 4:16 ׳ וגו ׳ עתה יִרְעֵם י Hos 5:7 ; Hos 8:8 ; Hos 8:13 ( Jer 14:10 ), Jer 10:2 . \\ \\ c. of a time ideally present (= then , from our point of view): Isa 29:22 לא עתה יבושׁ יעקב , v b Hos 10:3 ; Mic 4:9 ; Mic 4:10 ; Mic 4:11 ; Mic 4:14 ; Mic 5:3 . \\ \\ d. describing a present state = as things are: 1Sam 8:5 thou art old, etc., עתה שִׂימָה לנו מלך , 1Sam 9:6 ; 1Sam 13:12 ; 1Sam 14:30 ; 1Sam 25:7 b; 1Sam 27:1 now I shall be swept away one day, etc., 2Kgs 18:20 ; 2Kgs 18:25 ; Job 6:21 ; Job 14:16 ; Job 16:7 . \\ \\ e. with an Imperative, as an encouragement, implying that the time has come for the exhortation or advice to be followed, Gen 31:13 עתה קים צא , Exod 18:19 עתה שְׁמַע בקולי , Num 22:11 ; Deut 2:13 ; 1Sam 30:8 . 2. Phrases: \\ \\ a. עַתָּה זֶה ( זְה 4 h ) 1Kgs 17:24 ; 2Kgs 5:22 . \\ \\ b. ועתה and, now , or now , therefore ( וְ 4 ), drawing a conclusion, especially (compare 1 e ) a practical one, from what has been stated: Gen 3:22 and now (since man has once been disobedient), lest he put forth his hand, etc., Gen 20:7 ; Gen 20:23 וְעַתָּה הִשָּֽׁבְעָה לִי הֵ֫נָּה , Gen 27:3 ; Gen 27:8 ועתה בני שְׁמַע בקולי , Gen 30:30 ; Gen 31:16 ; Gen 31:44 ; Gen 37:20 + often, Isa 5:3 ; Isa 5:5 ; Ps 2:10 ; Gen 11:6 ׳ ועתה לאֹיִֿבָּצֵר מֵהֶם וגו , Gen 31:30 ; Gen 45:8 ; 2Sam 19:11 ; Ps 39:8 ועתה מַהקִּֿזִּיתִי אֲדֹנָי , Isa 52:5 , \\ \\ c. וְעַתָּה הִנֵּה stating the ground on which some conclusion or action is to be based, Exod 3:9 ; Josh 14:10 (twice in verse); 1Sam 12:2 ; 1Sam 24:21 ; 1Kgs 1:18 ; Jer 40:4 (with ועתה usually repeated afer the הנה -clause). \\ \\ d. גם עתה Gen 44:10 ; 1Sam 12:16 ; 1Kgs 14:14 ; Joel 2:12 ; Job 16:19 . \\ \\ e. מֵעַתָּה from now, henceforth , Jer 3:4 ; Isa 48:6 ; Dan 10:17 (according to some, here = from just now ), 2Chr 16:9 מעתה ועד עוּלּסּ , see above 1 a end. feminine עַדעַֿתָּה until now , Gen 32:5 , ׳ וֶאֵחַר עדעֿ , Deut 12:9 ׳ אל הנחלה לא באתם עד ע (opposed to the future), 2Kgs 13:23 especially after clause with מִן , 2Kgs 46:34 ׳ מִנְּעוּרֵינוּ וְעַדעֿ ( 2Sam 19:8 ; Ezek 4:14 ), Exod 9:18 ; 2Kgs 8:6 ; Ruth 2:7 . \\ \\ g. כִּי עַתָּה for in this case , in our idiom, for them ( עתה pointing to a condition assumed as a possible contingency: compare Dr § 141, 142 ); (a) Exod 9:15 כי עתה ׳ שׁלחתי וגו for then (if the intention expressed in v Exod 9:14 had not existed) I should have put forth my hand, etc., Num 22:29 כי עתה הֲרַגְתִּיךְ , 1Sam 13:13 ; Job 3:13 followed by imperfect Job 6:3 for then (if it were weighed, v Job 6:2 ) it would be heavier, etc., Job 13:19 for then would I be silent and die; (b) after a protasis, surely then Gen 31:42 + (see כִּי 1 d b , p. 472). — Note. Read כְּמוֺ עַתָּ ) ( ᵐ5 ᵑ9 ) as now , for כְּמוֺ עֵת Ezek 16:57 , עַתָּ נִשְׁבַּרְתְּ ( ᵐ5 ᵑ6 ᵑ9 ) now art thou broken ! for עֵת נִשְׁבֶּרֶת Ezek 27:34 , and probably עַתָּ בָּא ( Hi We Kö Now , compare ᵐ5 ᵑ6 ) for עֶתבּֿאֹ Hag 1:2 also עַתָּה for אַתָּה 1Kgs 1:20 , and אַתָּה for עַתָּה v 1Kgs 1:18 b 2Sam 18:3 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6199')\">BDB6199</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6258')\">H6258</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H2088')\">H2088</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H2009')\">H2009</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H5704')\">H5704</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H3588')\">H3588</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6198')\">BDB6198</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6200')\">BDB6200</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עַתָּ֫ה</bdbheb><sub>435</sub> (also <ref ref=\"Ezek 23:43\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(26,23,43)\">Ezek 23:43</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 74:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"74\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"74\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,74,6)\">Ps 74:6</ref> <bdbheb>עת</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>עַתָּה</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>עָ֑֫תָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 32:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,5)\">Gen 32:5</ref> +, <b>adverb</b> of time, <highlightword>now</highlightword> (properly accusative of [<highlight>`int</highlight>],<bdbheb>עֵת</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>ii. 260</sup></lookup>), <highlight>at the time</highlight>, in particular of the present time, i.e. <highlight>now</highlight>; compare German <highlight>zur Zeit</highlight>, Arabic <placeholder3949/> <highlight>at the time</highlight>, i.e. <highlight>now); — now:</highlight> <div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> <ref ref=\"Gen 12:19\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(1,12,19)\">Gen 12:19</ref> <bdbheb>ועתה הנה אשׁתך</bdbheb> and <highlight>now</highlight>, behold thy wife, <ref ref=\"Gen 22:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,22,12)\">Gen 22:12</ref> <bdbheb>כי עתח ידעתי</bdbheb> <highlight>now</highlight>, I know (so <ref ref=\"Exod 18:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,11)\">Exod 18:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 17:13\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(7,17,13)\">Judg 17:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:24\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,24)\">1Kgs 17:24</ref> [<bdbheb>עַתָּה זֶה</bdbheb>], <ref ref=\"Ps 20:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,20,7)\">Ps 20:7</ref>), <ref ref=\"Gen 26:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,26,22)\">Gen 26:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 26:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,26,29)\">Gen 26:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 27:36\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,36)\">Gen 27:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 31:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,13)\">Gen 31:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 31:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,28)\">Gen 31:28</ref>, etc., <ref ref=\"Exod 5:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,5,5)\">Exod 5:5</ref> <bdbheb>הך רבים עתה עם הארץ</bdbheb>; whether in opposed to past time, as <ref ref=\"Gen 32:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,11)\">Gen 32:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 14:11\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(6,14,11)\">Josh 14:11</ref> <bdbheb>כְּכֹחִי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>אָז וּכְכֹחִי עָ֑תָּה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Judg 11:8\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(7,11,8)\">Judg 11:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:4\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,4)\">1Kgs 12:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 1:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,21)\">Isa 1:21</ref> <bdbheb>ועתה מרצחים</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Isa 16:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,16,14)\">Isa 16:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 2:9\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,9)\">Hos 2:9</ref> <bdbheb>כִּי טוֺב לִי אָז מַעָ֑תָּה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Hos 13:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,2)\">Hos 13:2</ref>, <ref ref=\"Job 30:1\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,1)\">Job 30:1</ref> +, or to future, as <ref ref=\"Num 24:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,24,17)\">Num 24:17</ref> <bdbheb>אֶרְאֶנּוּ ולא עתה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Judg 8:6\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,6)\">Judg 8:6</ref> <bdbheb>חֲכַף</bdbheb> <bdbheb>עַתָּהכְּֿיָדֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>זֶבַח וצ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:16\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,16)\">1Sam 2:16</ref> <bdbheb>כִּי עַתָּה תִּתֵּן</bdbheb>; = <highlight>after all</highlight> <ref ref=\"Num 22:38\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(4,22,38)\">Num 22:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 8:2\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,2)\">Judg 8:2</ref> = <highlight>now at last</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Sam 24:16\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(10,24,16)\">2Sam 24:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:4\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(11,19,4)\">1Kgs 19:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 19:25\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(12,19,25)\">2Kgs 19:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 7:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,2)\">Hos 7:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 4:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,12)\">Jer 4:12</ref> and in the phrase <bdbheb>מעתה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>ועד עולם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 9:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,9,6)\">Isa 9:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 59:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,59,21)\">Isa 59:21</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><wrongReferenceRemoved/> (see below), <ref ref=\"Ps 113:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"113\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"113\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,113,2)\">Ps 113:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 115:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"115\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"115\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,115,18)\">Ps 115:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 121:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"121\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"121\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,121,8)\">Ps 121:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 125:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"125\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"125\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,125,2)\">Ps 125:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 131:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"131\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"131\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,131,3)\">Ps 131:3</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of the imminent or impending future: <ref ref=\"Gen 19:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,9)\">Gen 19:9</ref> <bdbheb>עַתָּה נָרַע לְךָ מַהֶם</bdbheb>. <ref ref=\"Gen 29:32\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(1,29,32)\">Gen 29:32</ref> <bdbheb>כי עתה יאהבני אישׁי</bdbheb>, v<ref ref=\"Gen 29:34\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(1,29,34)\">Gen 29:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 6:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,6,1)\">Exod 6:1</ref> <bdbheb>עתה תראה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Num 11:23\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,23)\">Num 11:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 22:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,22,4)\">Num 22:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:6\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,6)\">2Sam 20:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 33:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,10)\">Isa 33:10</ref> (<ref ref=\"Ps 12:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,12,6)\">Ps 12:6</ref>), <ref ref=\"Isa 43:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,19)\">Isa 43:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 49:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,19)\">Isa 49:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 6:7\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(30,6,7)\">Amos 6:7</ref> <bdbheb>לכן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>עתה יִגְלוּ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Isa 49:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,19)\">Isa 49:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 7:4\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,4)\">Mic 7:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 7:10\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,10)\">Mic 7:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 10:20\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(27,10,20)\">Dan 10:20</ref> and especially <grk>ἀσυνδέτως</grk> in Hosea, introducing a punishment, <ref ref=\"Hos 4:16\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(28,4,16)\">Hos 4:16</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וגו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עתה יִרְעֵם י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 5:7\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(28,5,7)\">Hos 5:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 8:8\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(28,8,8)\">Hos 8:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 8:13\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(28,8,13)\">Hos 8:13</ref> (<ref ref=\"Jer 14:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,14,10)\">Jer 14:10</ref>), <ref ref=\"Jer 10:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,2)\">Jer 10:2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> of a time <highlight>ideally</highlight> present (= <highlight>then</highlight>, from our point of view): <ref ref=\"Isa 29:22\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,22)\">Isa 29:22</ref> <bdbheb>לא עתה יבושׁ יעקב</bdbheb>, v<sup>b</sup> <ref ref=\"Hos 10:3\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(28,10,3)\">Hos 10:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 4:9\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(33,4,9)\">Mic 4:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 4:10\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(33,4,10)\">Mic 4:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 4:11\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(33,4,11)\">Mic 4:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 4:14\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(33,4,14)\">Mic 4:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 5:3\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(33,5,3)\">Mic 5:3</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> describing a present state = <highlight>as things are:</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Sam 8:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,8,5)\">1Sam 8:5</ref> thou art old, etc., <bdbheb>עתה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>שִׂימָה לנו מלך</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"1Sam 9:6\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(9,9,6)\">1Sam 9:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 13:12\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(9,13,12)\">1Sam 13:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:30\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,30)\">1Sam 14:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,7)\">1Sam 25:7</ref>b; <ref ref=\"1Sam 27:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,27,1)\">1Sam 27:1</ref> <highlight>now</highlight> I shall be swept away one day, etc., <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:20\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,20)\">2Kgs 18:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:25\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,25)\">2Kgs 18:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 6:21\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,21)\">Job 6:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 14:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,14,16)\">Job 14:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 16:7\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(18,16,7)\">Job 16:7</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> with an Imperative, as an encouragement, implying that the time has come for the exhortation or advice to be followed, <ref ref=\"Gen 31:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,13)\">Gen 31:13</ref> <bdbheb>עתה קים צא</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Exod 18:19\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,19)\">Exod 18:19</ref> <bdbheb>עתה שְׁמַע בקולי</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Num 22:11\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(4,22,11)\">Num 22:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 2:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,13)\">Deut 2:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 30:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,30,8)\">1Sam 30:8</ref>.</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p></div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> Phrases: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <bdbheb>עַתָּה זֶה</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>זְה</bdbheb> <b>4 h</b>) <ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:24\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,24)\">1Kgs 17:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 5:22\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(12,5,22)\">2Kgs 5:22</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>ועתה</bdbheb> and, <highlight>now</highlight>, or <highlight>now</highlight>, therefore (<bdbheb>וְ</bdbheb> <b>4</b>), <highlightword>drawing a conclusion, especially</highlightword> (compare <b>1 e</b>) <highlightword>a practical one, from what has been stated:</highlightword> <ref ref=\"Gen 3:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,22)\">Gen 3:22</ref> <highlight>and now</highlight> (since man has once been disobedient), lest he put forth his hand, etc., <ref ref=\"Gen 20:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,7)\">Gen 20:7</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Gen 20:23\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,23)\">Gen 20:23</ref> <bdbheb>וְעַתָּה הִשָּֽׁבְעָה לִי הֵ֫נָּה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Gen 27:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,3)\">Gen 27:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 27:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,8)\">Gen 27:8</ref> <bdbheb>ועתה בני שְׁמַע</bdbheb> <bdbheb>בקולי</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Gen 30:30\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(1,30,30)\">Gen 30:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 31:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,16)\">Gen 31:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 31:44\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,44)\">Gen 31:44</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 37:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,37,20)\">Gen 37:20</ref> + often, <ref ref=\"Isa 5:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,3)\">Isa 5:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 5:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,5)\">Isa 5:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 2:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,2,10)\">Ps 2:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 11:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,6)\">Gen 11:6</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ועתה לאֹיִֿבָּצֵר מֵהֶם וגו</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Gen 31:30\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,30)\">Gen 31:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 45:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,45,8)\">Gen 45:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,11)\">2Sam 19:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 39:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,39,8)\">Ps 39:8</ref> <bdbheb>ועתה מַהקִּֿזִּיתִי אֲדֹנָי</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Isa 52:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,52,5)\">Isa 52:5</ref>, <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <bdbheb>וְעַתָּה הִנֵּה</bdbheb> stating the ground on which some conclusion or action is to be based, <ref ref=\"Exod 3:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,3,9)\">Exod 3:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 14:10\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(6,14,10)\">Josh 14:10</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"1Sam 12:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,12,2)\">1Sam 12:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 24:21\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(9,24,21)\">1Sam 24:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:18\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,18)\">1Kgs 1:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 40:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,40,4)\">Jer 40:4</ref> (with <bdbheb>ועתה</bdbheb> usually repeated afer the <bdbheb>הנה</bdbheb>-clause). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <bdbheb>גם עתה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 44:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,44,10)\">Gen 44:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 12:16\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(9,12,16)\">1Sam 12:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 14:14\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(11,14,14)\">1Kgs 14:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Joel 2:12\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(29,2,12)\">Joel 2:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 16:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,16,19)\">Job 16:19</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <bdbheb>מֵעַתָּה</bdbheb> <highlight>from now, henceforth</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Jer 3:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,3,4)\">Jer 3:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 48:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,48,6)\">Isa 48:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 10:17\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(27,10,17)\">Dan 10:17</ref> (according to some, here = from <highlight>just now</highlight>), <ref ref=\"2Chr 16:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,16,9)\">2Chr 16:9</ref> <bdbheb>מעתה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>ועד עוּלּסּ</bdbheb>, see above <b>1 a</b> <highlight>end.</highlight> <b>feminine</b> <bdbheb>עַדעַֿתָּה</bdbheb> <highlight>until now</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 32:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,5)\">Gen 32:5</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וֶאֵחַר עדעֿ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Deut 12:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,9)\">Deut 12:9</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אל הנחלה לא באתם עד ע</bdbheb> (opposed to the future), <ref ref=\"2Kgs 13:23\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(12,13,23)\">2Kgs 13:23</ref> especially after clause with <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb>, <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"2Kgs 46:34\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(12,46,34)\">2Kgs 46:34</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִנְּעוּרֵינוּ וְעַדעֿ</bdbheb> (<ref ref=\"2Sam 19:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,8)\">2Sam 19:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 4:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,4,14)\">Ezek 4:14</ref>), <ref ref=\"Exod 9:18\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,18)\">Exod 9:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 8:6\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(12,8,6)\">2Kgs 8:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ruth 2:7\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(8,2,7)\">Ruth 2:7</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>g.</b> <bdbheb>כִּי עַתָּה</bdbheb> <highlight>for in this case</highlight>, in our idiom, <highlight>for them</highlight> (<bdbheb>עתה</bdbheb> pointing to a condition assumed as a possible contingency: compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup>§ 141, 142</sup></lookup>); (a) <ref ref=\"Exod 9:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,15)\">Exod 9:15</ref> <bdbheb>כי עתה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁלחתי וגו</bdbheb> for <highlight>then</highlight> (if the intention expressed in v<ref ref=\"Exod 9:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,14)\">Exod 9:14</ref> had not existed) <highlight>I should have</highlight> put forth my hand, etc., <ref ref=\"Num 22:29\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(4,22,29)\">Num 22:29</ref> <bdbheb>כי עתה הֲרַגְתִּיךְ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"1Sam 13:13\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(9,13,13)\">1Sam 13:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 3:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,13)\">Job 3:13</ref> followed by imperfect <ref ref=\"Job 6:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,3)\">Job 6:3</ref> for <highlight>then</highlight> (if it were weighed, v<ref ref=\"Job 6:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,2)\">Job 6:2</ref>) it would be heavier, etc., <ref ref=\"Job 13:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,19)\">Job 13:19</ref> <highlight>for then</highlight> would I be silent and die; (b) after a protasis, <highlight>surely then</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 31:42\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,42)\">Gen 31:42</ref> + (see  <bdbheb><reflink>כִּי</reflink></bdbheb> <b>1 d</b> <highlight>b</highlight>, p. 472). — Note. Read <bdbheb>כְּמוֺ עַתָּ</bdbheb>) (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>) <highlight>as now</highlight>, for <bdbheb>כְּמוֺ עֵת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 16:57\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"57\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"57\" onclick=\"bcv(26,16,57)\">Ezek 16:57</ref>, <bdbheb>עַתָּ נִשְׁבַּרְתְּ</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>) <highlight>now art thou broken !</highlight> for <bdbheb>עֵת נִשְׁבֶּרֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:34\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,34)\">Ezek 27:34</ref>, and probably <bdbheb>עַתָּ בָּא</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hi')\">Hi</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>) for <bdbheb>עֶתבּֿאֹ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hag 1:2\" b=\"37\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(37,1,2)\">Hag 1:2</ref> also <bdbheb>עַתָּה</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>אַתָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:20\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,20)\">1Kgs 1:20</ref>, and <bdbheb>אַתָּה</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>עַתָּה</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:18\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,18)\">1Kgs 1:18</ref>b <ref ref=\"2Sam 18:3\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(10,18,3)\">2Sam 18:3</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Ezek 23:43", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 23, "verse": 43}, {"raw": "Ps 74:6", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 74, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Gen 32:5", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 32, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Gen 12:19", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 12, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Gen 22:12", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 22, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Exod 18:11", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 18, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Judg 17:13", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 17, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "1Kgs 17:24", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 17, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Ps 20:7", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 20, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Gen 26:22", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 26, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Gen 26:29", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 26, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "Gen 27:36", "book": "GEN", "c